Package: jouriepi
Type: Package
Title: Clinical Epidemiology and Biostatistics Analysis Engine
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-03
Authors@R: person("Ghaith", "Baccari", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "baccarighaith18@gmail.com")
Author: Ghaith Baccari [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Ghaith Baccari <baccarighaith18@gmail.com>
Description: Provides deterministic, offline-first methods for clinical
    epidemiology and biostatistics. Includes 2x2 contingency-table estimates
    (risk ratios, odds ratios and risk differences), exact and asymptotic tests,
    and an explicitly labelled Haldane-Anscombe correction for odds-ratio
    sensitivity analysis (Haldane, 1956) <doi:10.1111/j.1469-1809.1955.tb01285.x>.
    Additional methods cover Mantel-Haenszel
    stratification, diagnostic accuracy, DeLong receiver-operating-characteristic
    comparisons, additive interaction, VanderWeele-Ding E-values (VanderWeele
    and Ding, 2017) <doi:10.7326/M16-0828>, decision-curve analysis (Vickers and
    Elkin, 2006) <doi:10.1177/0272989X06295361>, paired
    McNemar analysis, Fagan post-test probabilities, line-list quality review,
    epidemic curves and Cori-style reproduction-number estimation (Cori et al.,
    2013) <doi:10.1093/aje/kwt133>. Functions
    return structured S3 results and perform no graphical, browser or network
    operations.
